  "label": "User projected onto the accusation scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the overall accusation scene, which visually and textually vilifies Justin Trudeau by associating him with the act of awarding compensation to a terrorist. The user's perspective is implied through the accusatory tone and the direct targeting of the individual (Justin_Trudeau) and his political role (Canadian Prime Minister), creating a sense of personal moral outrage directed at him. The meme does not use explicit deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the framing and emotional language ('fucking scum bag') create an implicit projection of the user's own moral judgment and anger onto the scene and its central figure.",
